<title>ARGENTINA: SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-ARGENTINE CHAMPIONSHIP RESULTS/STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results of Argentine</p>
<p>Clausura championship matches played at the weekend:</p>
<p> Boca Juniors	     1   Deportivo Espanol	   3</p>
<p> Colon			0   Independiente		 6</p>
<p> Estudiantes		1   Gimnasia-La Plata	   0</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy	   2   Union			   0</p>
<p> Huracan Corrientes     2   Ferro Carril Oeste	  1</p>
<p> Lanus			3   Velez Sarsfield	     1</p>
<p>(abandoned 80th minute -- crowd trouble)</p>
<p> Platense		   1   Huracan			 3</p>
<p> Racing Club		1   River Plate		   2</p>
<p> San Lorenzo		3   Newell's Old Boys	   0</p>
<p>Standings (tabulate under played, won, drawn, lost, goals</p>
<p>for, goals against, points)</p>
<p> River Plate		  15  9  4  2 32 20 31</p>
<p> Newell's Old Boys	  15  9  4  2 20 14 31</p>
<p> Independiente		15  9  3  3 34 17 30</p>
<p> Colon			  15  7  7  1 31 23 28</p>
<p> Velez Sarsfield	    14  8  3  3 21 11 27</p>
<p> Racing Club		  15  7  3  5 20 18 24</p>
