<p> Union			  15  6  4  5 25 25 22</p>
<p> Gimnasia-La Plata	  15  5  5  5 17 21 20</p>
<p> Ferro Carril Oeste	 15  4  7  4 18 17 19</p>
<p> Boca Juniors		 15  4  6  5 27 26 18</p>
<p> Platense		     15  4  6  5 18 21 18</p>
<p> Deportivo Espanol	  15  3  6  6 16 19 15</p>
<p> Huracan-Corrientes	 15  2  9  4 16 23 15</p>
<p> Huracan			15  3  6  6 16 28 15</p>
<p> Estudiantes		  15  4  2  9 14 21 14</p>
<p> Rosario Central	    14  2  6  6 16 19 12</p>
<p> Lanus			  14  2  6  6 12 17 12</p>
<p> Gimnasia-Jujuy	     15  2  6  7 17 28 12</p>
<p> Banfield		     14  2  3  9 13 24  8</p>
<p>Note: the Clausura is the second of two championships</p>
<p>played in the Argentine season. The teams meet each other</p>
<p>once in each and there is no overall champion.</p>
